<title>INDIA: FOREIGN FUND INVESTMENT IN INDIA $8.67 BLN - SEBI.</title>
<headline>FOREIGN FUND INVESTMENT IN INDIA $8.67 BLN - SEBI.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreign funds accumulated investment in India totalled $8.67 billion up to August 11, D.R. Mehta, chairman of Securities and Exchange Board of India, said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Mehta told a news conference foreign fund investment so far in August amounted to $65 million.</p>
<p>-- Bombay Newsroom (91) 265 9000</p>
</text>
